ffmpeg and ffprobe
------------------
Required on PATH for ingest probe, proxies, thumbnails, shot detection, and
publishing. ffmpeg is typically LGPL or GPL depending on how the binary was
built. Obtain ffmpeg from its distributors and honour the license of the
build you install. Volt does not ship ffmpeg.

faster-whisper (optional extra `speech`)
----------------------------------------
Used when VOLT_ASR_ENGINE=faster-whisper. The Python package and the speech
models it downloads carry their own terms. Install with
`pip install volt-control[speech]`.

Optional storage and database SDKs
----------------------------------
The Volt control plane has no required Python dependencies. These packages
are installed only with extras; honour each project's license when you
install the extra.

- boto3 (`s3` extra): Apache-2.0
- azure-storage-blob and azure-identity (`azure` extra): MIT
- google-cloud-storage (`gcs` extra): Apache-2.0
- psycopg and psycopg_pool (`postgres` extra): LGPL-3.0. They are installed
  by the user as separate packages and imported at run time; Volt does not
  bundle or modify them. If you redistribute a bundle that includes them,
  LGPL-3.0 obligations (notice, source of the library, the right to replace
